    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange Jigsaws is a puzzle game where you solve strange jigsaws. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Solve around 50 or so strange jigsaws, each with their own surprising way of being solved. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore unusual puzzle worlds themed after jigsaws. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enter the Jigsawverse, maybe. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a spiritual sequel to my game &quot;20 Small Mazes&quot;, but it's a little bit harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I recommend playing the game using keyboard and mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notes on puzzle accessibility: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game is color-blind friendly. There are two puzzles that use color and they both have a &quot;colorblind mode&quot; toggle on the puzzle itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game has accessibility options for hard of hearing or deaf people. There are three separate track of subtitles: background music, sound effects, and voices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Some puzzles require knowledge of English. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange Jigsaws is a puzzle game where you solve strange jigsaws. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Solve around 50 or so strange jigsaws, each with their own surprising way of being solved. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore unusual puzzle worlds themed after jigsaws. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enter the Jigsawverse, maybe. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a spiritual sequel to my game &quot;20 Small Mazes&quot;, but it's a little bit harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I recommend playing the game using keyboard and mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notes on puzzle accessibility: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game is color-blind friendly. There are two puzzles that use color and they both have a &quot;colorblind mode&quot; toggle on the puzzle itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game has accessibility options for hard of hearing or deaf people. There are three separate track of subtitles: background music, sound effects, and voices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Some puzzles require knowledge of English. </p></li></ul>",
